<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine wheat up on export demand.</title>
<headline>Argentine wheat up on export demand.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine wheat was up in busy trade at the Buenos Aires Cereals Exchange, on export demand, traders said.</p>
<p>Buenos Aires millers wheat was up $1 at 136. Soybeans were boosted by U.S. markets with May Buenos Aires soybeans up $3 at 268. Rosario soybeans for May delivery also rose $3 to 268. Other products saw little market activity, said traders.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
